          Enkh-Amgalan <span>Entwan</span> Enkhbayar.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-bio">
          I am a <strong>Data Scientist</strong> and <strong>AI Engineer</strong> @
          <a class="hero-inline-link hero-company-link" href="https://powerserve.global/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/images/hero/powerserve.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><span class="hero-company-name">PowerServe Systems Ltd</span><span class="hero-link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>, currently based in London, UK.
        </p>

        <p class="hero-bio">
          I graduated from
          <a class="hero-inline-link hero-university-link" href="https://www.bucks.ac.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/images/hero/uni.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><span class="hero-university-name">Buckinghamshire New University</span><span class="hero-link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          with BSc(Hons) in Artificial Intelligence in June 2025.
        </p>

        <p class="hero-bio">
          I have so many interests, ranging from technology to sports, arts, motorcycles etc haha. Currently working on AI agents and cloud computing platforms.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-links" aria-label="Profile links">
          <a class="hero-cv-link" href="/cv/Enkh-Amgalan_CV.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span>View CV</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
